    "use": {
      "kind": "rule",
      "does": "The 'use' command on a bag sigil: refused (nothing spent) if the hero's god forbids it (Grumbok every sigil; any other god a sigil carved with a mote of its forbidden element), if the hero is Feared, or by the sigil's own refusedWhen. Otherwise it takes one action, spends one sigil from the stack, plays the cast clip and the sigil sound, runs the effects, makes that sigil kind known for the run, and records it as the last sigil read (Amulet of Echoes). A sigil with a picker opens it first; choosing pays, 'Keep the sigil' cancels at no cost. Puzzle rooms near the reader react (world.md).",
